function TfrmCancelamentoDocumentos.fExisteCTe(strNumDoc, strSerie_, strCodEmp: string; var strEmpCli, strClienteCTe, strFornecedorCTe, strChaveDeAcessoCTe, strImportouCTe: string): Boolean;
var
  strSQL: string;
  qryAux: TUniQuery;
begin
  strSQL := '';
  strSQL := strSQL + 'SELECT ';
  strSQL := strSQL + '  CTE_NUMCTE, ';
  strSQL := strSQL + '  CTE_EMPCLI, ';
  strSQL := strSQL + '  CTE_TOMSER, ';
  strSQL := strSQL + '  CTE_IMPORT, ';
  strSQL := strSQL + '  CTE_ACESSO, ';
  strSQL := strSQL + '  EE.EMP_FORFIL AS FORFIL, ';
  strSQL := strSQL + '  EC.EMP_CLIFIL AS CLIFIL, ';
  strSQL := strSQL + '  GER_CODCLI ';
  strSQL := strSQL + 'FROM ';
  strSQL := strSQL + '  MOVCTE ';
  strSQL := strSQL + '  JOIN CADEMP EE ON CTE_CODEMP = EE.EMP_CODEMP ';
  strSQL := strSQL + '  JOIN CADEMP EC ON CTE_EMPCLI = EC.EMP_CODEMP ';
  strSQL := strSQL + '  JOIN MOVGER ON CTE_SEQGER = MOVGER.AUTOINCREM ';
  strSQL := strSQL + 'WHERE ';
  strSQL := strSQL + '  CTE_NUMCTE = :NUMCTE ';
  strSQL := strSQL + '  AND CTE_SERIE_ = :SERIE_ ';
  strSQL := strSQL + '  AND CTE_CODEMP = :CODEMP ';

  qryAux := fCriaQuery();
  try
    qryAux.SQL.Add(strSQL);
    strSQL := AnsiReplaceStr(strSQL, 'MOVCTE', 'NOTCTE');
    strSQL := AnsiReplaceStr(strSQL, 'MOVGER', 'NOTGER');
    qryAux.SQL.Add('UNION ALL ');
    qryAux.SQL.Add(strSQL);
    qryAux.ParamByName('NUMCTE').AsString := RightStr(strNumDoc, 9);
    qryAux.ParamByName('SERIE_').AsString := strSerie_;
    qryAux.ParamByName('CODEMP').AsString := IIF(fEmptyStr(strCodEmp), VS_strCodEmp, strCodEmp);
    qryAux.Open;

    Result := not qryAux.IsEmpty;

    if Result then
    begin
      strEmpCli := qryAux.FieldByName('CTE_EMPCLI').AsString;
      if (qryAux.FieldByName('CTE_TOMSER').AsString[1] = '3') then
        strClienteCTe := qryAux.FieldByName('GER_CODCLI').AsString
      else
        strClienteCTe := qryAux.FieldByName('CLIFIL').AsString;
      strFornecedorCTe    := qryAux.FieldByName('FORFIL').AsString;
      strImportouCTe      := qryAux.FieldByName('CTE_IMPORT').AsString;
      strChaveDeAcessoCTe := qryAux.FieldByName('CTE_ACESSO').AsString;
    end;
  finally
    FreeAndNil(qryAux);
  end;
end;

